        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stupid coachman! You nearly ran me over! Get back here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pcknmrn",
        "channel": "step1",
        "loop": false,
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_carriagegoaway",
        "channel": "step2",
        "loop": false,
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "step1",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "step2",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That dung-for-brains ran off, just like that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Rory, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, look who DID get run over! Serves you right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not going anywhere now! Let's go see the Dublinn folks. Maybe they'll give me potatoes for handing over a traitor\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Better stick to the back streets. Can't have someone else taking my spy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 25,
        "ystrength": 25,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The man grabs the boy's collar and drags him into a small, empty alley. The boy groans in anguish."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g1_citystreets_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weird. Did I forget the way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gimme back my potatoes! Go and buy your own! They still have some at the shop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voices in the Distance"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give them back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voices in the Distance"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They still have potatoes?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man glances towards the voices, then at the broken body of the boy whose arm he is still grabbing."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's dying. Would the Dublinners even give me anything for a dying kid? Could they even get anything out of him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's your lucky day, traitor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "xstrength": 25,
        "ystrength": 25,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The man shakes off the boy's hand, which had been grabbing his sleeve, and walks off briskly towards the voices."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "My leg... it hurts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothtrailground",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't stand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1696_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrs. Emma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1696_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-Who's there? Who's calling my name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I did as you asked! Just leave me alone\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Emma!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1696_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theo? What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I got hit by a carriage, then left behind here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not a Victorian spy, Mrs. Emma... Please, help me... take me to Mr. Culann...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1696_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Victorian... spy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... it's all happening so fast...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "It hurts so much...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know the Victorians did bad things. Nobody likes me, nobody listens to me, nobody wants to get close to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "But could you at least... find Mr. Culann... it hurts... it's so cold...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I grow up... I'll find the Victorians and take revenge... for Mr. Niels...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1696_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Takes a deep breath)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I'd have helped you, Theo, if Niels was the only one who died.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrs... Emma?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1696_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know that Niels died in the war, but even more people died without ever seeing the battlefield.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "You Victorians blocked off the supply routes. You still are. So many people starved. Including me, including...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Including the child Niels left behind... the child inside me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "He starved to death because of you Victorians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Find someone else to get Culann for you. They're all good people, unlike me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Very good people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
