        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodcracle",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Emma. How could you do that to him, Emma...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What could have changed you so much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not defending her, Culann, but she wasn't the only one there that day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, she wasn't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, shouldn't have said that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, you're absolutely right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanted to take Theo with you, didn't you? What did you see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was being bullied. And I'm not talkin' squabbles between kids... by adults.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I intervened the first time I saw it. I thought... I thought it wouldn't happen again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it did. A lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had a bad feeling that he didn't belong here, that there was no place for him in Na Saoirs\u00ed. But I never thought...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. You should go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Culann?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I said I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I SAID I UNDERSTAND! NOW GO! GET OUT! LEAVE ME\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Leave me be for a while. Please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "bw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "channel": "bw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The blacksmith stands silent in the room. All is quiet save for the crackling of the fire."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theo, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Too many things have passed him by, too many things he could not understand. He no longer has the strength to find out why, to separate cause from effect."
    },
    {
        "text": "The only thing he knows is that he never achieved anything."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of hero am I?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. What kind of hero are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "The blacksmith looks around him. There is no one else in the smithy, save the empty eye sockets of the dragon statue, now glaring at him accusingly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of hero are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... what kind of hero am I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of hero would leave a child to the mercy of abuse and ill-will?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of hero would allow food to be smuggled out of the city under his very nose, until there is nothing left. All while doing nothing more than handing out a few shriveled potatoes to his neighbors?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of hero would shut himself in his smithy while the city descends into bedlam, all to satisfy his own pathetic vanity by etching his name into a pedestal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-It's not out of vanity. All I wanted was to use the title of 'hero' to... to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "'To bring happiness to our countrymen who lost everything in the war,' as you told Nemos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like... now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The weak you swore to protect are dead and gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "The justice you swore to uphold has fallen into darkness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people you swore to bring happiness to... Emma and Rory... are they even your people anymore?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or are they the dead, living in the past?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The dead... living in the past?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your heart still dreams of the future, vain as it is. But them? They are the walking dead, stuck in the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it you are calling your countrymen? The wretch who spends his days brandishing an antique sword he salvaged from the flames?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "The smuggler who let an innocent child die because she miscarried her own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Townsfolk' who no longer know anything but hate in the face of change?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on, go out and find someone, anyone. Ask them what their plan for the future is. What do you think the answer will be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_speardrop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The blacksmith's hammer falls to the ground with a loud crash."
    },
    {
        "text": "He glares at the dragon's head."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's you who's trapping them in the past...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I collected the plates and bowls my people used day to day, lit the fuel they relied on for warmth and light, just to feed you... you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "You monster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know about the food. But the metal and the fuel...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was me. I fed you those pots and pans, I put the people's livelihoods into your mouth with my own hands, all so that you could grow and grow...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've devoured everything in my life, then you devoured Theo himself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theo... Theo...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was me, I nurtured the monster that took your life!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Soon it will stand in the square on Samhain, spread its wings, and turn everyone in the city into the dead, those who can only live in the past...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, monster. I'm no hero.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a fraud. A vain, pathetic fraud. Once, I fooled others; now, the only one I'm fooling is myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they need me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "They need you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They need a hero to wake them up, to tell them that the war is over, that what really matters is what lies ahead. The future. Tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you think you're the one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm the one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The blacksmith walks away from the forge with resolute steps. He takes the thickest metal chain he can find and walks back to the dragon, its empty eyes still fixated upon him."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_ironchaindrop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To the square.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not Samhain yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can wait no more. I will not wait for your ominous prophecies to come true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will dismantle you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "And return our lives to the people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The dragon does not move. In the eyes of the blacksmith, however, he sees the dragon bow its head, perhaps mockingly, perhaps invitingly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
