    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g10_indoor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loading_intro",
        "key": "$loading_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reed, Nemos, I'm back. Culann's in a real bad place right now. You should go see him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about on your end? What's going on in the city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "People are still looking for spies... Victorian spies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they off their rockers? Taran or Victorian, we're all human. We gonna keep fighting to the death like this, when the war's already over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell them, Nemos. Tell 'em that Dublinn made 'em go hungry, and was punished by the Red Dragon. The food's now\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not mention the word Dublinn ever again, Brigid. The Leader's orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... only overheard whispers about the food at the victory party. No evidence, no trial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't even know how it got back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides\u2014news about all those missing people hasn't spread at all... How am I supposed to explain it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they can't be reasoned with, we'll do this the hard way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1694_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I came back, I told myself I would never be her shadow again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if the true Leader is refusing to show her face and take responsibility, then I must step up, if only to calm the people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Culann? Everyone knows him as a hero. Things would be much simpler if he's willing to help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He should still be at his smithy. I'll lead the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you, Brigid, you should leave the city as soon as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... if we and Culann both fail, then the people will...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. They don't much like me here, so I'd just get in the way, is that it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Brigid, that's not what I meant, but\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I'll try my luck in the Dark Woods. Sixth time's the charm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
